\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Example}

\import{discrete-macros}


\p{“#{1369} is a perfect square.” ##{\exists n:\N. n^2 = 1369} This also happens to be true. Note that this is much nicer than trying to write something like ##{\mathrm{IsInteger}(\sqrt{n}).} #{\sqrt{-}} is complicated, and we don’t know how to define #{\mathrm{IsInteger}}.}
